            "value": "Nadpisania: BREE_SOCKET_ENABLE, BREE_SOCKET_MODE i BREE_SOCKET_PATH (ustaw BREE_ALLOW_SOCKET_OVERRIDE=1 dla wersji stabilnych/nightly)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
